@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<section class="page-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">

        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">Last updated: April 2026</p>

        <div class="privacy-content">

            <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
            <p>When you register for ARTNEST, we collect your name, email address, and a securely hashed password. We also store artworks you save to your wishlist and journal entries you create.</p>

            <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
            <p>Your information is used solely to provide the ARTNEST service — specifically to maintain your personal artwork collection, wishlist, and journal. We do not sell or share your data with third parties.</p>

            <h3>3. Data Security</h3>
            <p>Passwords are stored using secure hashing (BCrypt). Your personal data is stored in a private database and is only accessible through your authenticated account session.</p>

            <h3>4. Cookies &amp; Sessions</h3>
            <p>ARTNEST uses session cookies to keep you logged in during your visit. These cookies expire after 30 minutes of inactivity and contain no personal information.</p>

            <h3>5. Your Rights</h3>
            <p>You may update your name, email, and password at any time in the Settings page. If you wish to have your account and data removed, please contact us.</p>

            <h3>6. Contact</h3>
            <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, you can reach us through the ARTNEST application.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>
